SUMMARY:Go (Game) Evening at Techinc
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTSTART:20260803T170000Z
DTEND:20260803T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Just an evening to play a friendly game of go (AKA Baduk or Wie
 qi). I will teach go (the game) and we will play. Don't expect high level 
 play. There will also be other games in the genre available\, e.g. Chess a
 nd Hive. The location is a shared workshop where members are free to organ
 ize events. There are soft drinks available for sale\, but you're welcome 
 to bring your own. If you're not a member\, you can just show up and phone
  the number on the front door\, and someone will come down and let you in.
  Discussion of the programming language is not encouraged\, but tolerated.
  https://wiki.techinc.nl/Go_Evening_2026-08-03
LOCATION:Technologia Incognita Louwesweg 1 Amsterdam Netherlands
URL:https://radar.squat.net/en/event/amsterdam/technologia-incognita/2026-0
 8-03/go-game-evening-techinc
CATEGORIES:bar/cafe
END:VEVENT
