DTSTAMP:20260802T154420Z
SUMMARY:ABC Community bike repair event
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTSTART:20260804T110000Z
DTEND:20260804T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:ABC Community bike repair event Is your bike making a weird noi
 se? Do you just need a 15mm wrench to tighten the wheels? Or do you want t
 o pimp your ride? ABC is hosting a community bike repair session at the Vr
 ankrijk on the 1st and 3rd Tuesdays of the month from 13:00-18:00. This ev
 ent is hosted by the ABC\, the Anarchist Bike Collective. We want to truly
  build bike sharing. With the growing repression on activist and demonstra
 tors it is crucial we build community resources and practice non-violent p
 rovocation. Inspired by Provo's white bikes we have been fixing and distri
 buting bikes with combination locks throughout Amsterdam. So if you want t
 o fix your bike\, or have ideas on how to source\, maintain and utilise tr
 ue bike sharing come by for a tea. Anarchist Bike Collective is looking fo
 r more ppl who know something about bikes to help guide folks during our e
 vents. We are a small non-hierarchical group of anarchists who are right n
 ow focused on our bike repair cafe but with more people and time we can br
 ing back our bike-sharing! We are looking for ppl who can help others repa
 ir their bikes\, and provide some guidance for those with less experience.
  If you know someone or are someone who would be interested\, please come 
 to our next ABC event on Tues Nov 4 from 13:00-18:00 at the Vrankrijk. Or 
 email us at Abikecollective@protonmail.com ⁩
LOCATION:Vrankrijk Spuistraat 216  Amsterdam Pays-Bas
URL:https://radar.squat.net/en/event/amsterdam/vrankrijk/2026-08-04/abc-com
 munity-bike-repair-event
CATEGORIES:diy workshop
END:VEVENT
