DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260827
DESCRIPTION:Screens and Streams in the Age of Climate Crisis 26+27 august 2
 026 Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam panel 2: digital Fieke Jansen\, Universit
 y of Amsterdam Securing the Market: AI\, Predicting Hazards\, and Managing
  Vulnerability Michał Pabiś-Orzeszyn\, University of Lodz Intertwining S
 copes: Assessing the Environmental Footprint of an AI-Driven Art Project H
